---
import BaseLayout from '@/components/BaseLayout.astro';
import EmailLink from '@/components/EmailLink.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Read how BloxTier handles technical visitor data, advertising cookies, third-party services, privacy choices, and contact requests." path="/privacy/">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="surface rounded-lg p-6 md:p-8">
      <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-mint">Privacy</p>
      <h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-black text-white">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-base leading-8 text-white/72">
        <p>BloxTier is a static-first information site. We do not require visitors to create accounts, provide Roblox credentials, or submit personal profile information to use the site.</p>
        <p>Hosting providers and security services may process standard technical data such as IP address, user agent, referrer, request time, and requested URL so the site can load and remain reliable.</p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white">Analytics choices</h2>
        <p>BloxTier uses Google Analytics 4 to understand page visits, aggregate content usage, content-card selections, compare-tool changes, and site performance. Google Analytics loads only after analytics consent is accepted on bloxtier.com.</p>
        <p>You can reject analytics, accept analytics, withdraw your choice, or reopen the choice panel from the Privacy Choices link in the footer. If analytics is rejected, BloxTier does not load the Google Analytics tag for that visit.</p>
        <p>Analytics consent is separate from advertising consent. Accepting analytics grants analytics storage only; ad storage, ad user data, and ad personalization remain denied in this site's consent setup.</p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white">Advertising cookies</h2>
        <p>BloxTier is prepared for future advertising disclosures, but this implementation does not load Google AdSense tags and does not provide a Google-certified advertising CMP. If advertising is enabled later, the notice and consent controls will need to be updated before ad cookies or personalized advertising signals are used.</p>
        <p>Visitors can control or opt out of personalized Google advertising through <a class="text-mint" href="https://adssettings.google.com/">Google Ads Settings</a>. Additional industry opt-out choices are available at <a class="text-mint" href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/">aboutads.info</a>.</p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white">Contact</h2>
        <p>Privacy questions can be sent to <EmailLink class="text-mint" />.</p>
        <p>Last updated July 27, 2026.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
